{
 "total": 32.72,
 "planned": false,
 "beats": [
  {
   "text": "This octopus mom guarded her eggs for four and a half years.",
   "visual": "hook",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.248
  },
  {
   "text": "In 2007, scientists found her with fresh eggs, deep off California.",
   "visual": "rov_finds",
   "start": 3.248,
   "end": 7.598
  },
  {
   "text": "So they came back to check on her.",
   "visual": "rov_returns",
   "start": 7.598,
   "end": 9.237
  },
  {
   "text": "Eighteen times.",
   "visual": "eighteen",
   "start": 9.237,
   "end": 10.362
  },
  {
   "text": "She was always there, covering her eggs.",
   "visual": "covering",
   "start": 10.362,
   "end": 12.444
  },
  {
   "text": "Crabs and shrimp walked right up to her.",
   "visual": "crabs",
   "start": 12.444,
   "end": 14.244
  },
  {
   "text": "But she didn't eat them.",
   "visual": "crabs",
   "start": 14.244,
   "end": 15.182
  },
  {
   "text": "She pushed them away.",
   "visual": "push",
   "start": 15.182,
   "end": 16.3
  },
  {
   "text": "The water there is barely above freezing.",
   "visual": "cold",
   "start": 16.3,
   "end": 18.425
  },
  {
   "text": "So the eggs grow very slowly.",
   "visual": "eggs_grow",
   "start": 18.425,
   "end": 20.303
  },
  {
   "text": "Month after month, she got paler.",
   "visual": "paler",
   "start": 20.303,
   "end": 22.159
  },
  {
   "text": "Then one day, she was gone.",
   "visual": "gone",
   "start": 22.159,
   "end": 23.825
  },
  {
   "text": "Only empty eggs were left.",
   "visual": "gone",
   "start": 23.825,
   "end": 25.591
  },
  {
   "text": "Her babies had hatched.",
   "visual": "hatch",
   "start": 25.591,
   "end": 26.981
  },
  {
   "text": "No animal has ever guarded its eggs longer.",
   "visual": "record",
   "start": 26.981,
   "end": 29.691
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow BioNiche for more weird animals.",
   "visual": "cta",
   "start": 29.691,
   "end": 32.72
  }
 ],
